			"text": "The light building's distant look (the kits' second level of detail): its baked facade atlas, not metallic, roughness 0.5, flat. Maps from sources/ (albedo, orm, normal), 512 px. The ...PNG8 groups only store exact file values; leave them. Export: File > Export material > Godot > Godot 4 Standard into data/models/board/textures/structures/buildings (or tools/materials/export.py), then Reload assets in the game's Tuning panel.",
